d 'LOEVH2': module to calculate Loevinger's H for two dichotomous variables
d
d  loevh2 calculates Loevinger's H (= RIOC) for two dichotomous
d variables. loevh2i is the immediate command for loevh2.
d loevh2_boot provides bootstrapped confidence intervals.
d loevh2_booti is the immediate command for loevh2_boot. loevh2_svy
d allows pweight etc. via svyset. loevh2_meta_save shared
d subroutine used by loevh2, loevh2_boot, and loevh2_svy.
d loevh2_meta_writedo helper for loevh2_meta_save. 
d
d KW: Loevinger's H
d KW: association measure
d KW: Bootstrap confidence intervals
d KW: overlap of two binary variables
d KW: RIOC (relative improvement over chance)
d
d Requires: Stata version 16
d
d Distribution-Date: 20260820
d
d Author: Dirk Enzmann, University of Hamburg
d Support: email dirk.enzmann@@uni-hamburg.de
d
f loevh2.ado
f loevh2.sthlp
f loevh2i.ado
f loevh2i.sthlp
f loevh2_boot.ado
f loevh2_boot.sthlp
f loevh2_booti.ado
f loevh2_booti.sthlp
f loevh2_svy.ado
f loevh2_svy.sthlp
f loevh2_meta_save.ado
f loevh2_meta_writedo.ado
